Commodity grouping cannot add account totals.

========== API ==========

aggregate({ groupBy: 'commodity', inValuationCommodity: true, includeTotal: true })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
commodity NOK
P 2024-01-01 FUND 10 SEK
P 2024-01-02 FUND 12 NOK
P 2024-01-02 NOK 1.1 SEK

2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Cash  100.000000000000000001 SEK
  Assets:Fund  2 FUND {10 SEK}
  Equity:Opening

2024-01-02 Adjust cash
  Assets:Cash  = 150 SEK
  Equity:Opening

2024-01-03 Future
  Assets:Cash  1000 SEK
  Equity:Opening

========== ERROR ==========

includeTotal cannot be used when grouping by commodity
